5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure we can actually build this on time. I'll check the firms and the depot notes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'm interested in how people actually use the space and the drainage issues. I'll look into the crossing counts and heat readings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder who will take care of the park every day. I'll check the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to see how previous projects have held up. I'll look at the earlier programme works and the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the long-term costs. I will examine the upkeep ledger and the habitat fund terms.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
