50,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"We have Wetland Restoration, Market Plaza, Woodland Walk, and Sports Terraces. I vote for the Wetland.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The Wetland Restoration addresses the heat and drainage while utilizing the habitat fund. I vote Wetland.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Since we have habitat volunteers and the staff is low, I vote for Wetland Restoration.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Minako,,The earlier basin works prove that water management lasts. I vote for Wetland Restoration.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is expensive to maintain, but the fund and the durability make it the best choice. Wetland.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
